1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,015
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Turli xil rasmiyatchiliklar. Qiyin, to'g'rimi? Videoning qaysidir joyida yapon tilida savol beriladi. Agar eshitsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

2
00:00:20,015 --> 00:00:23,015
1-qism: Yashash joyini ro'yxatdan o'tkazish tartibi

3
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:25,055
Kechirasiz.

4
00:00:25,078 --> 00:00:28,645
Yaponiyaga yangi keldim.

5
00:00:28,668 --> 00:00:32,101
Yashash joyimni ro'yxatdan o'tkazmoqchiman.

6
00:00:32,124 --> 00:00:34,324
Xush kelibsiz!

7
00:00:34,347 --> 00:00:37,044
Tuman idorasiga xush kelibsiz.

8
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:40,001
Yangi manzilni ro'yxatdan o'tkazish kerak, to'g'rimi?

9
00:00:40,024 --> 00:00:42,763
Ha, shunday.

10
00:00:42,786 --> 00:00:45,753
Juda asabim bo'lmoqda.

11
00:00:45,776 --> 00:00:48,176
Hech qisiqmasin.

12
00:00:48,199 --> 00:00:53,888
Avvaliga mijozning yashash kartasi va pasportini ko'rsatib bering.

13
00:00:53,911 --> 00:00:56,525
Ha, bor.

14
00:00:56,548 --> 00:01:00,243
Sumkadan chiqaraman.

15
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:02,200
Bu.

16
00:01:02,223 --> 00:01:04,390
Marhamat.

17
00:01:04,413 --> 00:01:06,079
Rahmat.

18
00:01:06,102 --> 00:01:08,302
Olip qolaman.

19
00:01:08,325 --> 00:01:11,532
Yaponiyaga qachon keldingiz?

20
00:01:11,556 --> 00:01:15,322
O'tgan juma kuni keldim.

21
00:01:15,345 --> 00:01:17,351
Tushunarli.

22
00:01:17,375 --> 00:01:22,648
Endi bu 'ko'chib kelish bildirishnomasi' degan qog'ozni to'ldiring.

23
00:01:22,671 --> 00:01:24,485
Yaxshi.

24
00:01:24,508 --> 00:01:27,766
A, savolim bor.

25
00:01:27,790 --> 00:01:32,362
Ism ustidagi furigana nima?

26
00:01:32,385 --> 00:01:36,385
Bu ismni qanday o'qish kerakligini ko'rsatadi.

27
00:01:36,408 --> 00:01:38,411
Katakana bilan yozing.

28
00:01:38,435 --> 00:01:40,968
Katakana, tushunarli.

29
00:01:40,991 --> 00:01:43,127
Tushunarli.

30
00:01:43,151 --> 00:01:47,984
Sizning mamlakatingiz va hozirgi ismingizni yozing.

31
00:01:48,007 --> 00:01:49,578
Yaxshi.

32
00:01:49,602 --> 00:01:52,369
Manzilni qayerga yozish kerak?

33
00:01:52,392 --> 00:01:55,792
Bu keng joyga yozing.

34
00:01:55,814 --> 00:01:59,110
Yangi kvartiraning manzili.

35
00:01:59,133 --> 00:02:01,023
Tushunarli.

36
00:02:01,047 --> 00:02:05,280
Manzildagi kanji belgilari juda qiyin.

37
00:02:05,303 --> 00:02:09,336
Smartfon ekraniga qarab yozsam bo'ladimi?

38
00:02:09,359 --> 00:02:12,833
Ha, albatta bo'ladi.

39
00:02:12,857 --> 00:02:15,756
Sekin-asta va aniq yozing.

40
00:02:15,779 --> 00:02:18,232
Rahmat.

41
00:02:18,256 --> 00:02:21,432
Yaponiyaning manzili uzun ekan.

42
00:02:21,456 --> 00:02:24,989
Xonadon raqamini ham yozish kerakmi?

43
00:02:25,012 --> 00:02:26,587
Yaxshi.

44
00:02:26,611 --> 00:02:31,944
Kvartira nomi va xonadon raqami ham muhim, shuning uchun yozing.

45
00:02:31,967 --> 00:02:34,100
Tushunarli.

46
00:02:34,123 --> 00:02:37,400
302-xona, to'g'rimi?

47
00:02:37,424 --> 00:02:39,459
Yozib bo'ldim.

48
00:02:39,482 --> 00:02:41,215
Rahmat.

49
00:02:41,238 --> 00:02:45,272
Tug'ilgan sanangiz va telefon raqamingizni ham shu yerga yozing.

50
00:02:45,296 --> 00:02:49,829
Hali Yaponiyaning telefon raqamim yo'q.

51
00:02:49,852 --> 00:02:52,419
Nima qilish kerak?

52
00:02:52,442 --> 00:02:54,486
Shundaymi.

53
00:02:54,509 --> 00:02:59,276
Maktab yoki ish joyingizning telefon raqami bormi?

54
00:02:59,299 --> 00:03:00,934
Yaxshi.

55
00:03:00,958 --> 00:03:04,134
Yapon tili maktabining telefon raqami bor.

56
00:03:04,157 --> 00:03:06,209
Shuni yozaman.

57
00:03:06,232 --> 00:03:09,524
Ha, shu bilan kifoya.

58
00:03:09,548 --> 00:03:11,238
Tayyor bo'ldim.

59
00:03:11,262 --> 00:03:13,541
Bu hammasi mi?

60
00:03:13,564 --> 00:03:16,331
Iltimos, tekshirib koʻring.

61
00:03:16,354 --> 00:03:19,120
Ha, koʻrsatib qoʻying.

62
00:03:19,143 --> 00:03:24,943
Ism, manzil, tugʻilgan sana va maktab raqami, shundaymi?

63
00:03:24,966 --> 00:03:27,263
Mukammal.

64
00:03:27,287 --> 00:03:29,663
Yaxshi boʻldi.

65
00:03:29,686 --> 00:03:31,620
Endi xotirjam boʻldim.

66
00:03:31,644 --> 00:03:35,012
Endi kartani tayyorlaymiz.

67
00:03:35,035 --> 00:03:39,602
Iltimos, u yerda koʻk stulda oʻtirib kutib turing.

68
00:03:39,625 --> 00:03:43,832
Ha, qancha vaqt ketadi?

69
00:03:43,855 --> 00:03:46,822
15 daqiqa atrofida ketadi.

70
00:03:46,845 --> 00:03:50,742
Ismingizni chaqiraman, shuning uchun kutib turing.

71
00:03:50,766 --> 00:03:52,569
Tushunarli.

72
00:03:52,592 --> 00:03:55,392
Oʻtirib kutaman.

73
00:03:55,415 --> 00:03:57,415
Kutib turdingiz, rahmat.

74
00:03:57,439 --> 00:04:00,206
Yashash kartasini qaytarib beraman.

75
00:04:00,229 --> 00:04:01,847
Rahmat.

76
00:04:01,871 --> 00:04:04,638
Kartaning orqa tomoniga qarang.

77
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:08,795
Yangi manzilingiz shu yerda yozilgan.

78
00:04:08,818 --> 00:04:11,754
Voy, rostdan ham!

79
00:04:11,777 --> 00:04:16,453
Mening ismim va yangi manzilim aniq yozilgan.

80
00:04:16,477 --> 00:04:19,317
Juda xursandman.

81
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:21,174
Yaxshi boʻldi.

82
00:04:21,197 --> 00:04:25,163
Shu bilan aholi roʻyxatidan oʻtkazish jarayoni tugadi.

83
00:04:25,186 --> 00:04:26,820
Rahmat.

84
00:04:26,843 --> 00:04:30,914
Mehribonlik bilan tushuntirib berganingiz uchun xursand boʻldim.

85
00:04:30,938 --> 00:04:33,415
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

86
00:04:33,438 --> 00:04:36,576
Bu hali tugamadi.

87
00:04:36,599 --> 00:04:42,268
Keyin yon tarafdagi oynada sogʻliq sugʻurtasi uchun roʻyxatdan oʻtishingiz kerak.

88
00:04:42,292 --> 00:04:45,492
Ah, sogʻliq sugʻurtasi.

89
00:04:45,515 --> 00:04:47,482
Tushunarli.

90
00:04:47,505 --> 00:04:50,105
Yon tarafdagi oyna, shundaymi?

91
00:04:50,128 --> 00:04:52,195
Borib kelaman.

92
00:04:52,217 --> 00:04:59,323
Bugungi videodagi qayta koʻrish uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

93
00:04:59,323 --> 00:05:02,323
2-Sahna: Sogʻliq sugʻurtasi roʻyxatdan oʻtkazish jarayoni

94
00:05:02,323 --> 00:05:04,756
Kechirasiz.

95
00:05:04,779 --> 00:05:11,462
Yon tarafdagi oynada sogʻliq sugʻurtasi uchun roʻyxatdan oʻtish kerakligini aytishdi.

96
00:05:11,486 --> 00:05:14,185
Xush kelibsiz.

97
00:05:14,209 --> 00:05:18,675
Davlat sogʻliq sugʻurtasiga qoʻshilish uchun ariza berish kerak.

98
00:05:18,698 --> 00:05:22,632
Iltimos, avvalgi yashash kartangizni koʻrsatib qoʻying.

99
00:05:22,655 --> 00:05:25,126
Ha, mana bu.

100
00:05:25,149 --> 00:05:28,389
Ayni paytda manzilni yozib oldik.

101
00:05:28,412 --> 00:05:30,079
Rahmat.

102
00:05:30,103 --> 00:05:32,147
Tasdiqlaymiz.

103
00:05:32,170 --> 00:05:37,304
Sogʻliq sugʻurtasi Yaponiyada hayot kechirishda juda muhim.

104
00:05:37,326 --> 00:05:40,393
Ha, bilaman.

105
00:05:40,416 --> 00:05:45,216
Ammo sugʻurta tizimi yaxshi tushunmayapman.

106
00:05:45,239 --> 00:05:47,082
Xavotir olmang, tushuntirib beraman.

107
00:05:47,106 --> 00:05:48,981
Tushuntirib beraman.

108
00:05:49,004 --> 00:05:54,093
Yaponiyada kasal boʻlsangiz, kasalxonaga borasiz, shundaymi?

109
00:05:54,117 --> 00:05:55,650
Yaxshi.

110
00:05:55,673 --> 00:05:59,540
Kasal boʻlish juda tashvishli.

111
00:05:59,564 --> 00:06:02,932
Koʻp pul ham ketadimi?

112
00:06:02,956 --> 00:06:09,189
Bu sogʻliq sugʻurta guvohnomasi bilan kasalxonada toʻlashingiz kerak boʻlgan pul kamayadi.

113
00:06:09,212 --> 00:06:12,709
Faqat umumiy summaning 30 foizini toʻlaysiz.

114
00:06:12,732 --> 00:06:15,400
Faqat 30 foizmi?

115
00:06:15,424 --> 00:06:19,912
Qolgan 70 foizini toʻlash shart emasmi?

116
00:06:19,935 --> 00:06:23,935
Ha, qolganini davlat toʻlaydi.

117
00:06:23,958 --> 00:06:27,292
Shuning uchun juda xotirjam boʻlasiz.

118
00:06:27,315 --> 00:06:29,786
Bu ajoyib, rostdanmi?

119
00:06:29,809 --> 00:06:32,463
Biroz xotirjam boʻldim.

120
00:06:32,487 --> 00:06:38,181
Lekin har oy sugʻurta badalini toʻlash kerak boʻladi.

121
00:06:38,204 --> 00:06:41,238
Har oymi?

122
00:06:41,261 --> 00:06:43,757
Qanchadan-qancha boʻladi?

123
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:49,264
Men chet ellik talabaman, pulim kam.

124
00:06:49,288 --> 00:06:52,154
Hech qisiqmasin.

125
00:06:52,177 --> 00:06:58,650
Ish haqi kam boʻlganda yoki talaba boʻlganda sugʻurta badali arzonroq boʻladi.

126
00:06:58,674 --> 00:07:00,807
Arzonroqmi?

127
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:02,763
Yaxshi boʻldi.

128
00:07:02,786 --> 00:07:06,521
Qanchaga tushishini hozir bilib olsak boʻladi?

129
00:07:06,545 --> 00:07:12,378
Oʻtgan yili Yaponiyada boʻlmaganim uchun eng arzon narx boʻladi.

130
00:07:12,401 --> 00:07:15,568
Oyiga 2000 yen atrofida.

131
00:07:15,591 --> 00:07:18,265
Oyiga 2000 yenmi?

132
00:07:18,288 --> 00:07:22,455
Unday boʻlsa, men ham toʻlashim mumkin.

133
00:07:22,478 --> 00:07:24,693
Yaxshi boʻldi.

134
00:07:24,717 --> 00:07:29,599
Endi bu pulni toʻlash usulini tushuntirib beraman.

135
00:07:29,623 --> 00:07:31,889
Ha, iltimos.

136
00:07:31,912 --> 00:07:35,180
Bankdan avtomatik yechib olinadimi?

137
00:07:35,204 --> 00:07:41,887
Bankni roʻyxatdan oʻtkazish mumkin, lekin avvaliga toʻlov varaqasi degan qogʻoz uyga keladi.

138
00:07:41,910 --> 00:07:44,527
Toʻlov varaqasimi?

139
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:46,962
Bu nima?

140
00:07:46,986 --> 00:07:50,046
Shtrix-kodli qogʻoz.

141
00:07:50,069 --> 00:07:54,603
Har oy sizning uyga pochta orqali keladi.

142
00:07:54,626 --> 00:07:59,863
Ushbu qogʻozni olib, qayerda pul toʻlash mumkin?

143
00:07:59,887 --> 00:08:01,723
Bankdami?

144
00:08:01,746 --> 00:08:08,146
Bankda ham toʻlash mumkin, lekin doʻkonlar eng qulay joy.

145
00:08:08,169 --> 00:08:11,369
Kun boʻyi istalgan vaqtda toʻlash mumkin.

146
00:08:11,392 --> 00:08:15,392
Doʻkonlarda toʻlash mumkinmi?

147
00:08:15,415 --> 00:08:18,215
Bu juda qulay ekan.

148
00:08:18,238 --> 00:08:24,238
Ha, qogʻozni kassirga koʻrsatib, pulni toʻlang.

149
00:08:24,261 --> 00:08:28,294
Muddat bor, shuning uchun eʼtiborli boʻling.

150
00:08:28,317 --> 00:08:30,517
Tushunarli.

151
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:34,674
Qogʻoz kelgandan keyin darhol doʻkonga boraman.

152
00:08:34,697 --> 00:08:37,030
Ajoyib!

153
00:08:37,053 --> 00:08:41,853
Endi rasmiylashtirishni boshlaymiz, biroz kutib turing.

154
00:08:41,876 --> 00:08:44,209
Ha, iltimos.

155
00:08:44,232 --> 00:08:46,365
Kutib turdingiz, rahmat.

156
00:08:46,388 --> 00:08:52,755
Bu sizning Davlat tibbiy sugʻurta polisiniz.

157
00:08:52,778 --> 00:08:56,551
Nomi uzun boʻlsa-da, uni oddiygina sugʻurta polisi deyiladi.

158
00:08:56,574 --> 00:08:59,210
Bu sugʻurta polisimi?

159
00:08:59,234 --> 00:09:02,234
Kichik kartochka ekan.

160
00:09:02,257 --> 00:09:04,031
Yaxshi.

161
00:09:04,054 --> 00:09:09,054
Shifoxonaga borganda bu kartani olib boring.

162
00:09:09,077 --> 00:09:12,087
Hamyoningizga solib qoʻyish yaxshi boʻladi.

163
00:09:12,111 --> 00:09:13,758
Tushunarli.

164
00:09:13,781 --> 00:09:16,955
Har doim hamyonimda saqlayman.

165
00:09:16,979 --> 00:09:20,313
Bugundan boshlab foydalanishingiz mumkin.

166
00:09:20,336 --> 00:09:24,913
Salomat boʻling va Yaponiyadagi hayotingizdan zavqlaning.

167
00:09:24,936 --> 00:09:26,419
Yaxshi.

168
00:09:26,443 --> 00:09:31,410
Menga shunchalik mehribonlik bilan tushuntirib berganingiz uchun katta rahmat.

169
00:09:31,432 --> 00:09:34,832
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

170
00:09:34,855 --> 00:09:39,624
Agar qandaydir muammo boʻlsa, istalgan vaqtda kelishingiz mumkin.

171
00:09:39,648 --> 00:09:42,490
Ha, yana kelaman.

172
00:09:42,513 --> 00:09:44,551
Xayr.

173
00:09:44,575 --> 00:09:53,654
Tushungan boʻlsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

174
00:09:53,654 --> 00:09:56,654
3-Sahna: Bank hisobini ochish / Bank hisobini ochish

175
00:09:56,654 --> 00:09:59,134
Kechirasiz.

176
00:09:59,157 --> 00:10:03,976
Yangi bank hisobini ochmoqchiman.

177
00:10:03,999 --> 00:10:05,999
Xush kelibsiz!

178
00:10:06,022 --> 00:10:09,155
Yangi hisob ochish boʻlyapti, shundaymi?

179
00:10:09,178 --> 00:10:14,178
Bugun hisobni qanday maqsadda ochmoqchisiz?

180
00:10:14,201 --> 00:10:19,535
Yaponiyada aralash ish boshlayman, shuning uchun kerak.

181
00:10:19,558 --> 00:10:21,173
Tushunarli.

182
00:10:21,196 --> 00:10:27,045
Aralash ish uchun oylik toʻlov va har oy yashash xarajatlari uchun, shundaymi?

183
00:10:27,068 --> 00:10:30,354
Ha, shunday.

184
00:10:30,378 --> 00:10:36,429
Kompaniyadagi odam bu bankda hisob oching, dedi.

185
00:10:36,452 --> 00:10:38,622
Tushunarli.

186
00:10:38,645 --> 00:10:43,423
Avval shaxsingizni tasdiqlashimiz kerak boʻladi.

187
00:10:43,447 --> 00:10:47,724
Yashash guvohnomangiz va pasportingiz bormi?

188
00:10:47,748 --> 00:10:50,518
Ha, olib keldim.

189
00:10:50,542 --> 00:10:53,575
Sumkadan chiqaraman.

190
00:10:53,598 --> 00:10:55,845
Bu.

191
00:10:55,868 --> 00:10:57,668
Marhamat.

192
00:10:57,691 --> 00:10:59,294
Rahmat.

193
00:10:59,318 --> 00:11:01,752
Olip qolaman.

194
00:11:01,775 --> 00:11:05,775
Yashash muddati ham muammo emas ekan.

195
00:11:05,798 --> 00:11:11,642
Endi bu ariza blankasiga ismingiz va manzilingizni yozing.

196
00:11:11,665 --> 00:11:13,279
Yaxshi.

197
00:11:13,303 --> 00:11:16,403
Kanjilar va katakanalar bilan yozing.

198
00:11:16,426 --> 00:11:18,598
Iltimos.

199
00:11:18,621 --> 00:11:23,838
A, mijozim, bugun muhringizni olib keldingizmi?

200
00:11:23,862 --> 00:11:25,531
E?

201
00:11:25,554 --> 00:11:27,600
Muhrmi?

202
00:11:27,624 --> 00:11:31,190
Kechirasiz, olib kelmaganman.

203
00:11:31,213 --> 00:11:33,291
Nima qilsak boʻladi?

204
00:11:33,315 --> 00:11:38,353
Muhr boʻlmasa, hisob ochib boʻlmaydimi?

205
00:11:38,376 --> 00:11:41,748
A, muammo yoʻq.

206
00:11:41,772 --> 00:11:44,505
Shunchalik xavotirlanmang.

207
00:11:44,528 --> 00:11:50,528
Bizning bankimizda muhrsiz ham imzo bilan roʻyxatdan oʻtishingiz mumkin.

208
00:11:50,551 --> 00:11:52,751
Rostdanmi?

209
00:11:52,774 --> 00:11:55,049
Yaxshi boʻldi.

210
00:11:55,073 --> 00:11:57,342
Juda xavotirda edim.

211
00:11:57,365 --> 00:12:01,932
Yoʻq, muammo yoʻq.

212
00:12:01,955 --> 00:12:09,760
Endi bu toʻrtburchakli qismga imzongizni qoʻying.

213
00:12:09,784 --> 00:12:13,226
Pasportdagidek imzo qoʻysam yaxshi boʻladi, shundaymi?

214
00:12:13,249 --> 00:12:14,816
Yaxshi.

215
00:12:14,839 --> 00:12:17,805
Pasportdagidek imzo qoʻying, iltimos.

216
00:12:17,828 --> 00:12:19,795
Tushunarli.

217
00:12:19,819 --> 00:12:22,954
Toʻrtburchak ichiga yozdim.

218
00:12:22,977 --> 00:12:25,344
Bunday yaxshi boʻladi, shundaymi?

219
00:12:25,367 --> 00:12:28,985
Ha, juda yaxshi yozilgan.

220
00:12:29,009 --> 00:12:30,891
Rahmat.

221
00:12:30,914 --> 00:12:35,728
Keyin kesh-karta uchun maxfiy raqam tanlang.

222
00:12:35,752 --> 00:12:38,886
Maxfiy raqammi?

223
00:12:38,909 --> 00:12:41,242
Bu nima?

224
00:12:41,265 --> 00:12:46,398
Kartadan foydalanishda ishlatiladigan toʻrt xonali maxfiy raqam.

225
00:12:46,421 --> 00:12:48,438
Tushunarli.

226
00:12:48,462 --> 00:12:51,429
Toʻrtta raqam, shundaymi?

227
00:12:51,452 --> 00:12:53,028
Yaxshi.

228
00:12:53,051 --> 00:12:59,686
Bu qora asbobga hech kim koʻrmaydigan qilib ikki marta raqam kiriting.

229
00:12:59,710 --> 00:13:07,756
Tugʻilgan kun yoki 1234 kabi oddiy raqamlarni ishlatmang, diqqatli boʻling.

230
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:09,913
Tushunarli.

231
00:13:09,936 --> 00:13:13,829
Mening maxfiy raqamimni kiritaman.

232
00:13:13,853 --> 00:13:15,629
Tayyor bo'ldim.

233
00:13:15,652 --> 00:13:17,285
Rahmat.

234
00:13:17,308 --> 00:13:21,750
Rasmiylashtirishni bajaraman, iltimos, u yerda oʻtirib kutib turing.

235
00:13:21,774 --> 00:13:24,387
Ha, tushunarli.

236
00:13:24,411 --> 00:13:27,078
Iltimos.

237
00:13:27,100 --> 00:13:29,900
Kutib turganingiz uchun uzr.

238
00:13:29,923 --> 00:13:34,457
Bu sizning yangi hisobingiz va kesh-kartangiz.

239
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,556
Oh, katta rahmat!

240
00:13:36,579 --> 00:13:40,713
Endi aralash ish uchun pul olishim mumkin.

241
00:13:40,736 --> 00:13:42,944
Yaxshi boʻldi.

242
00:13:42,967 --> 00:13:46,540
Yaponiyadagi hayotingizda omad tilaymiz!

243
00:13:46,563 --> 00:13:48,163
Yaxshi.

244
00:13:48,186 --> 00:13:52,919
Mehribonlik bilan tushuntirib berganingiz uchun juda katta rahmat.

245
00:13:52,942 --> 00:13:55,676
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

246
00:13:55,699 --> 00:13:58,567
Xayr, yo'lga ehtiyot bo'ling.

247
00:13:58,590 --> 00:14:01,590
4-SAHNA: Yaponiyada SIM-karta shartnomasi boʻyicha boshlang'ich qoʻllanma

248
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:03,357
Kechirasiz.

249
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:07,380
Yaponiyaning smartfonidan foydalanmoqchiman.

250
00:14:07,403 --> 00:14:11,485
Yangi SIM-karta shartnomasi tuzish mumkinmi?

251
00:14:11,509 --> 00:14:13,542
Xush kelibsiz!

252
00:14:13,565 --> 00:14:17,198
Ha, albatta mumkin.

253
00:14:17,221 --> 00:14:21,021
Yangi SIM-karta shartnomasi, shundaymi?

254
00:14:21,044 --> 00:14:23,411
Ha, shunday.

255
00:14:23,434 --> 00:14:29,867
Yaponiyaga yangi kelganimdan, yapon telefon raqami kerak.

256
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:31,724
Tushunarli.

257
00:14:31,746 --> 00:14:38,380
Avval, ma'lumotlar hajmi rejalarini tanlaymiz.

258
00:14:38,403 --> 00:14:47,650
Bizning doʻkonimizda 3 GB, 10 GB, 30 GB va cheksiz rejalar mavjud.

259
00:14:47,674 --> 00:14:51,874
Eee, GB nima?

260
00:14:51,897 --> 00:14:57,230
Rejalar nomlari qiyin, yaxshi tushunmayapman.

261
00:14:57,253 --> 00:15:03,220
Koʻp kanji va inglizcha soʻzlar bor, boshim ogʻriyapti.

262
00:15:03,243 --> 00:15:06,981
Haha, muammo yoʻq.

263
00:15:07,004 --> 00:15:09,204
Ha, qiyin, shundaymi?

264
00:15:09,227 --> 00:15:11,960
Sekin oʻylaymiz.

265
00:15:11,983 --> 00:15:17,983
Siz tashqarida YouTube kabi videolarni koʻp koʻrasizmi?

266
00:15:18,006 --> 00:15:24,773
Ha, har kuni YouTube’dagi yaponcha videolarni koʻp koʻraman.

267
00:15:24,796 --> 00:15:28,963
Oʻrganish uchun istalgan vaqtda koʻrishni xohlayman.

268
00:15:28,986 --> 00:15:31,319
Ajoyib!

269
00:15:31,342 --> 00:15:39,742
Unda, 3 GB yoki 10 GB rejalar tez yetmay qoladi.

270
00:15:39,765 --> 00:15:46,535
Istalgan vaqtda xavfsiz videolar koʻrishni xohlasangiz, 30 GB rejasi eng tavsiya etiladi.

271
00:15:46,558 --> 00:15:49,172
30 GB, shundaymi?

272
00:15:49,195 --> 00:15:52,195
Unda xavfsiz boʻladi.

273
00:15:52,218 --> 00:15:54,917
Shu rejani tanlayman.

274
00:15:54,941 --> 00:16:00,193
Oʻzim aqlli tanlaganimdan juda xursandman.

275
00:16:00,216 --> 00:16:02,289
Yaxshi boʻldi.

276
00:16:02,312 --> 00:16:08,346
Endi, roʻyxatdan oʻtish uchun roʻyxatga olish kartangizni koʻrsatib qoʻying.

277
00:16:08,369 --> 00:16:10,535
Ha, mana bu.

278
00:16:10,558 --> 00:16:12,125
Marhamat.

279
00:16:12,148 --> 00:16:14,046
Rahmat.

280
00:16:14,069 --> 00:16:20,113
Har oy toʻlov uchun kredit kartangiz bormi?

281
00:16:20,136 --> 00:16:25,977
Ha, mening mamlakatimning kredit kartam bor, lekin ishlatish mumkinmi?

282
00:16:26,001 --> 00:16:33,080
Ha, bu yerda xalqaro brend belgisi boʻlsa, chet el kartasi ham ishlaydi.

283
00:16:33,103 --> 00:16:35,037
Yaxshi boʻldi.

284
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,527
Bu.

285
00:16:36,551 --> 00:16:37,837
Marhamat.

286
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,460
Olip qolaman.

287
00:16:40,483 --> 00:16:43,576
Ha, tekshirib koʻrdim.

288
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:49,738
Endi, bu planshet ekranida shartnomani tekshirib koʻring.

289
00:16:49,761 --> 00:16:54,528
Ha, koʻp yaponcha yozuvlar bor ekan.

290
00:16:54,551 --> 00:16:57,984
Faqat muhim joylarini tushuntirib beraman.

291
00:16:58,007 --> 00:17:03,540
Har oy toʻlovi va shartnoma muddati shu yerda yozilgan.

292
00:17:03,563 --> 00:17:06,207
Ha, tushundim.

293
00:17:06,231 --> 00:17:08,964
Narxi ham mos keladi.

294
00:17:08,987 --> 00:17:16,475
Endi, quyidagi toʻrtburchak maydonga barmoq yoki ruchka bilan elektron imzo qoʻying.

295
00:17:16,499 --> 00:17:19,265
Ekraniga toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri yozish kerakmi?

296
00:17:19,288 --> 00:17:21,767
Ha, shunday.

297
00:17:21,791 --> 00:17:24,924
Ismingizni yozing.

298
00:17:24,947 --> 00:17:26,781
Tushunarli.

299
00:17:26,804 --> 00:17:28,692
Yozib bo'ldim.

300
00:17:28,715 --> 00:17:30,392
Rahmat.

301
00:17:30,415 --> 00:17:33,058
Endi, SIM-kartani tayyorlaymiz.

302
00:17:33,082 --> 00:17:37,615
Taxminan 10 daqiqa ketadi, shu stulda kutib turing.

303
00:17:37,638 --> 00:17:40,005
Ha, tushundim.

304
00:17:40,028 --> 00:17:42,995
Kutib turdingiz, rahmat.

305
00:17:43,018 --> 00:17:47,885
Sizning smartfoningizga yangi SIM-kartani oʻrnatdik.

306
00:17:47,908 --> 00:17:53,283
Hozir internetga ulanishini sinab koʻramiz.

307
00:17:53,306 --> 00:17:55,440
Ha, iltimos.

308
00:17:55,463 --> 00:17:58,396
Qiziqib ketdim.

309
00:17:58,419 --> 00:18:00,952
A, ekranga qarang.

310
00:18:00,975 --> 00:18:03,913
Antena chiqdi.

311
00:18:03,937 --> 00:18:07,104
Internetni ochib koʻring.

312
00:18:07,127 --> 00:18:11,728
Vaa, YouTube sahifasi darhol ochildi.

313
00:18:11,751 --> 00:18:14,184
Juda tez.

314
00:18:14,207 --> 00:18:17,207
Testdan muvaffaqiyatli oʻtdik.

315
00:18:17,230 --> 00:18:23,063
Shundan boshlab bugundan yapon telefon raqami va internetdan foydalanishingiz mumkin.

316
00:18:23,086 --> 00:18:24,886
Juda xursandman!

317
00:18:24,909 --> 00:18:29,158
Shundan soʻng darhol doʻstlaringiz va oilangiz bilan bogʻlanishingiz mumkin.

318
00:18:29,181 --> 00:18:33,115
Mehribonligingiz uchun katta rahmat.

319
00:18:33,138 --> 00:18:36,304
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

320
00:18:36,327 --> 00:18:40,220
Yaponiyadagi hayotingizni zavqli oʻtkazing!

321
00:18:40,244 --> 00:18:43,244
5-Sahna: Yangi xonadon ijaraga olish / Yangi kvartira ijarasi shartnomasi

322
00:18:43,244 --> 00:18:45,444
Kechirasiz.

323
00:18:45,467 --> 00:18:49,201
Yangi xonadon ijaraga oldim.

324
00:18:49,223 --> 00:18:54,957
Bugun nihoyat shartnoma va kalitlarni olish kuni.

325
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:57,036
Xush kelibsiz!

326
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:59,497
Sizni kutayotgan edik.

327
00:18:59,521 --> 00:19:02,854
Yangi xonadon uchun shartnoma, shundaymi?

328
00:19:02,877 --> 00:19:06,527
Ha, iltimos yordam bering.

329
00:19:06,550 --> 00:19:09,750
Juda ham hayajonlanmoqdaman!

330
00:19:09,773 --> 00:19:15,340
Avval shartnoma shartlarini yakuniy tekshirib chiqamiz.

331
00:19:15,363 --> 00:19:22,218
Manzil: Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2.

332
00:19:22,241 --> 00:19:27,309
Uyning nomi „Midori-so“ 201-xona.

333
00:19:27,333 --> 00:19:30,420
Ha, xato yoʻq.

334
00:19:30,443 --> 00:19:34,076
Bu mening yangi uyim boʻladi-ku.

335
00:19:34,099 --> 00:19:41,156
Ijara haqi har oy 60 000 yen, har oy 25-kuniga qadar toʻlash kerak.

336
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:44,387
Ha, tushundim.

337
00:19:44,410 --> 00:19:48,489
Bank hisobimdan avtomatik toʻlayman.

338
00:19:48,513 --> 00:19:52,046
Shartnoma muddati 2 yil.

339
00:19:52,069 --> 00:19:58,685
Agar 2 yildan oldin koʻchib ketmoqchi boʻlsangiz, 1 oy oldin xabar berishingiz kerak.

340
00:19:58,709 --> 00:20:01,342
1 oy oldin, shundaymi?

341
00:20:01,365 --> 00:20:03,732
Tushunarli.

342
00:20:03,755 --> 00:20:07,635
Keyin boshlangʻich xarajatlarni tekshiramiz.

343
00:20:07,659 --> 00:20:14,508
Garov puli, minnatdorchilik puli va birinchi ijara haqi toʻlovlarini kecha tasdiqladik.

344
00:20:14,532 --> 00:20:19,098
Ha, onlayn bank orqali oʻtkazdim.

345
00:20:19,121 --> 00:20:22,210
Tasdiqlanganiga xursandman.

346
00:20:22,234 --> 00:20:29,567
Shartnoma tartiblari yakunlandi, endi yangi xonadon kalitlarini topshiraman.

347
00:20:29,590 --> 00:20:34,157
Vaa, bu mening xonadonimning kaliti ekanmi?

348
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:37,151
Juda ham xursandman!

349
00:20:37,174 --> 00:20:41,108
Ha, uni ehtiyotkorlik bilan saqlang.

350
00:20:41,131 --> 00:20:43,897
Iltimos, hech qachon yoʻqotmang.

351
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:47,687
Ha, har doim sumkamda saqlayman.

352
00:20:47,710 --> 00:20:53,768
Endi oxirida, uy uchun chiqindilarni tashlash qoidalarini batafsil tushuntiraman.

353
00:20:53,792 --> 00:20:59,089
Bu juda muhim. Chiqindilar qoidasi, shundaymi?

354
00:20:59,112 --> 00:21:04,398
Yaponiyada chiqindilarni ajratish qoidasi juda qattiq ekanligini eshitgan edim.

355
00:21:04,422 --> 00:21:10,889
Qoidalarni xato qilaman deb qoʻrqaman.

356
00:21:10,912 --> 00:21:13,479
Hech qisiqmasin.

357
00:21:13,502 --> 00:21:16,106
Shunchalik qoʻrqmang.

358
00:21:16,129 --> 00:21:19,696
Albatta, qoidalar koʻp.

359
00:21:19,719 --> 00:21:26,175
Yonuvchi chiqindi, yonmaydigan chiqindi, metall qutilar va qayta ishlanadigan chiqindilarga ajratish kerak.

360
00:21:26,199 --> 00:21:31,399
Vay, shuncha koʻp turi bormi?

361
00:21:31,422 --> 00:21:33,708
Qiyin koʻrinadi.

362
00:21:33,731 --> 00:21:39,470
Bundan tashqari, bu shaharda chiqindilarni tashlash kunlari belgilangan.

363
00:21:39,494 --> 00:21:45,129
Yonuvchi chiqindilarni seshanba va juma kunlari ertalab soat 8:00 gacha tashlang.

364
00:21:45,152 --> 00:21:48,249
Seshanba va juma, shundaymi?

365
00:21:48,273 --> 00:21:51,284
Eslay olamanmi, deb qoʻrqaman.

366
00:21:51,307 --> 00:21:53,374
Hech qisi, muammo yoʻq.

367
00:21:53,397 --> 00:21:59,045
Shuningdek, bu shaffof maxsus chiqindi paketlaridan foydalaning.

368
00:21:59,068 --> 00:22:02,702
Ularni supermarketdan xarid qilish mumkin.

369
00:22:02,725 --> 00:22:05,263
Maxsus chiqindi paketlari, shundaymi?

370
00:22:05,287 --> 00:22:08,566
Oʻz paketlarimdan foydalana olmaymanmi?

371
00:22:08,589 --> 00:22:13,556
Savatingizdagi sumkada chiqarsangiz, axlatni yigʻishtirib olishmaydi.

372
00:22:13,579 --> 00:22:15,465
Shundaymi.

373
00:22:15,488 --> 00:22:18,622
Haqiqatan ham qattiq qoidalar ekan.

374
00:22:18,645 --> 00:22:21,845
Lekin xavotir olmang.

375
00:22:21,868 --> 00:22:28,301
Siz mijozlarimiz uchun hafta kunlariga koʻra rasmlar bilan bezatilgan taqvim beramiz.

376
00:22:28,324 --> 00:22:31,857
Vaa, bu nima?

377
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:35,734
Rasmlar juda chiroyli ekan!

378
00:22:35,758 --> 00:22:42,046
Buni koʻrsangiz, qaysi kunda qaysi axlatni chiqarsangiz, darhol bilib olasiz.

379
00:22:42,070 --> 00:22:44,436
Ajoyib!

380
00:22:44,459 --> 00:22:49,892
Bunday boʻlsa, men ham xato qilmasdan axlat chiqara olaman.

381
00:22:49,915 --> 00:22:52,315
Yaxshi boʻldi.

382
00:22:52,338 --> 00:22:55,778
Xonangiz devoriga yopishtirib qoʻysangiz, qulay boʻladi.

383
00:22:55,802 --> 00:22:57,256
Yaxshi.

384
00:22:57,280 --> 00:23:00,213
Darhol xonam devoriga yopishtiraman.

385
00:23:00,236 --> 00:23:03,878
Yangi hayotim juda ham qiziqib ketdi.

386
00:23:03,902 --> 00:23:07,469
Omadingiz yor boʻlsin!

387
00:23:07,492 --> 00:23:11,368
Muammo tugʻilsa, har qachon koʻchmas mulk agentligiga murojaat qiling.

388
00:23:11,391 --> 00:23:13,263
Yaxshi.

389
00:23:13,287 --> 00:23:15,087
Rahmat.

390
00:23:15,110 --> 00:23:17,283
Borib kelaman.

391
00:23:17,307 --> 00:23:20,307
6-Sahna: Elektr energiyasini yoqish tartibi / Elektr energiyasini yoqish

392
00:23:20,307 --> 00:23:25,798
Allo, bugun kvartiraga koʻchib keldim.

393
00:23:25,821 --> 00:23:29,555
Elektr energiyasini yoqish uchun ariza berishni xohlayman.

394
00:23:29,578 --> 00:23:32,631
Qoʻngʻiroqingiz uchun rahmat.

395
00:23:32,655 --> 00:23:36,348
Tokio Elektr Markazi qoʻllab-quvvatlash xizmati.

396
00:23:36,371 --> 00:23:39,827
Yangi elektr energiyasini ishlata boshlaysizmi?

397
00:23:39,851 --> 00:23:42,518
Ha, shunday.

398
00:23:42,541 --> 00:23:49,382
Telefon orqali ariza berish yuzma-yuz emas, shuning uchun juda ham asabim chiqyapti.

399
00:23:49,405 --> 00:23:51,692
Hech qisiqmasin.

400
00:23:51,716 --> 00:23:55,887
Gaplarim tushunarli boʻlayapti?

401
00:23:55,910 --> 00:23:59,284
Sekin gaplashaman.

402
00:23:59,307 --> 00:24:01,604
Ha, yaxshi tushunaman.

403
00:24:01,627 --> 00:24:03,394
Rahmat.

404
00:24:03,417 --> 00:24:09,893
Avvaliga yangi manzilingiz va ismingizni aytib bering.

405
00:24:09,916 --> 00:24:20,316
Manzil: Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Midori-soʻnagi, 201-xona.

406
00:24:20,339 --> 00:24:29,272
Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Midori-soʻnagi 201-xona, shundaymi?

407
00:24:29,295 --> 00:24:31,295
Tasdiqlandi.

408
00:24:31,318 --> 00:24:35,086
Mening ismim Mariya.

409
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:37,361
Mariya xonim, shundaymi?

410
00:24:37,384 --> 00:24:39,123
Rahmat.

411
00:24:39,147 --> 00:24:44,001
Keyin telefon raqamingizni aytib bering.

412
00:24:44,024 --> 00:24:52,458
Hali yaponcha mobil telefonim yoʻq, shuning uchun yapon tili maktabining raqami ham boʻladimi?

413
00:24:52,481 --> 00:24:57,540
Ha, maktab raqami bilan ham boʻladi.

414
00:24:57,563 --> 00:24:59,763
Aytib bering.

415
00:24:59,786 --> 00:25:06,192
03-1234-5678.

416
00:25:06,216 --> 00:25:08,259
Rahmat.

417
00:25:08,283 --> 00:25:10,335
Roʻyxatdan oʻtkazildi.

418
00:25:10,358 --> 00:25:16,200
Elektr energiyasini ishlatishni boshlash sanasi bugungi 9-iyul, toʻgʻrimi?

419
00:25:16,224 --> 00:25:20,390
Ha, bugundan boshlab ishlatmoqchiman.

420
00:25:20,413 --> 00:25:25,348
Hozir xonada turibman, lekin elektr yoqilmayapti.

421
00:25:25,372 --> 00:25:28,542
Juda qorongʻi.

422
00:25:28,566 --> 00:25:30,232
Shundaymi.

423
00:25:30,255 --> 00:25:34,661
Endi elektr energiyasini yoqamiz.

424
00:25:34,685 --> 00:25:38,019
Ha, nima qilish kerak?

425
00:25:38,042 --> 00:25:42,685
Xonadagi avtomatni (breykerni) koʻtarib qoʻying.

426
00:25:42,708 --> 00:25:46,475
Ee, br-ey-ker, desangiz?

427
00:25:46,498 --> 00:25:49,031
Bu nima?

428
00:25:49,054 --> 00:25:51,489
Yaxshi tushunmadim.

429
00:25:51,512 --> 00:25:58,046
Breyker – bu elektr kalitlari toʻplangan qora rangli qutidir.

430
00:25:58,069 --> 00:26:00,935
Qora rangli qutimi?

431
00:26:00,958 --> 00:26:03,592
Qayerda joylashgan?

432
00:26:03,615 --> 00:26:05,748
Koʻrmayapman.

433
00:26:05,771 --> 00:26:13,611
Odatda, kirish joyi tepasidagi devorda, kir yuvish joyi yoki oshxonaga yaqin baland joyda boʻladi.

434
00:26:13,635 --> 00:26:16,310
Eshikning ustidami?

435
00:26:16,333 --> 00:26:19,344
Qidirib ko'rayapman.

436
00:26:19,367 --> 00:26:23,101
A, biror quti bor.

437
00:26:23,124 --> 00:26:26,257
Bu tugmasi bor qutimi?

438
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:29,613
Qopqogʻini ochib koʻring.

439
00:26:29,636 --> 00:26:31,836
Ha, ochdim.

440
00:26:31,859 --> 00:26:35,793
Ichida kichik-kichik koʻplab tugmalar bor.

441
00:26:35,816 --> 00:26:40,073
Eng katta tugma oʻchirilgan holatdami?

442
00:26:40,096 --> 00:26:42,630
Yoqish kerak.

443
00:26:42,654 --> 00:26:45,187
Oʻchirilgan holatda.

444
00:26:45,210 --> 00:26:48,277
Buni yuqoriga koʻtarish kerakmi?

445
00:26:48,300 --> 00:26:52,306
Ha, uni yuqoriga koʻtaring.

446
00:26:52,329 --> 00:26:54,339
Tushunarli.

447
00:26:54,362 --> 00:26:56,647
Biraz qoʻrqyapman.

448
00:26:56,671 --> 00:26:58,690
Koʻtarayapman.

449
00:26:58,713 --> 00:27:03,286
Ey! Vov! Elektr yonib oʻchdi.

450
00:27:03,310 --> 00:27:06,276
Xona juda yorugʻ boʻldi.

451
00:27:06,299 --> 00:27:08,533
Yaxshi boʻldi.

452
00:27:08,556 --> 00:27:12,233
Endi elektr muammosiz ochildi.

453
00:27:12,256 --> 00:27:13,825
Rahmat.

454
00:27:13,848 --> 00:27:17,582
Breker soʻzini birinchi marta eshitdim.

455
00:27:17,605 --> 00:27:21,738
Oʻzim qila olganimdan juda hayratdaman.

456
00:27:21,761 --> 00:27:26,028
Hahaha, yordam bera olganimdan xursandman.

457
00:27:26,052 --> 00:27:29,109
Bugundan boshlab istalgan vaqtda elektrdan foydalaning.

458
00:27:29,132 --> 00:27:30,703
Yaxshi.

459
00:27:30,726 --> 00:27:36,493
Yuzingizni koʻrmay turib, juda mehribonlik bilan tushuntirib berdingiz, shuning uchun ham xotirjam boʻldim.

460
00:27:36,516 --> 00:27:39,370
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

461
00:27:39,394 --> 00:27:42,760
Ha, chin chinlarimdan rahmat.

462
00:27:42,783 --> 00:27:45,783
7-Sahna: Suv taʼminoti boshlash tartibi

463
00:27:45,783 --> 00:27:47,950
Kechirasiz.

464
00:27:47,973 --> 00:27:50,940
Janubiy Suv Boshqarmasimi?

465
00:27:50,963 --> 00:27:53,805
Yangi koʻchib keldim.

466
00:27:53,829 --> 00:27:58,162
Suvni yoqish uchun ariza berishni xohlayman.

467
00:27:58,185 --> 00:28:00,785
Qoʻngʻiroqingiz uchun rahmat.

468
00:28:00,808 --> 00:28:04,041
Janubiy Suv Boshqarmasi.

469
00:28:04,064 --> 00:28:06,798
Suvni yoqish tartibi, shundaymi?

470
00:28:06,821 --> 00:28:09,454
Ha, shunday.

471
00:28:09,477 --> 00:28:15,810
Yapon tilim hali yaxshi emas, shuning uchun juda asabiy boʻlyapman.

472
00:28:15,833 --> 00:28:18,513
Hech qisiqmasin.

473
00:28:18,537 --> 00:28:21,509
Sekin gaplashaman.

474
00:28:21,532 --> 00:28:27,305
Avval mijozning yangi manzili va ismini aytib bering.

475
00:28:27,329 --> 00:28:34,600
Manzil: Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2.

476
00:28:34,623 --> 00:28:40,664
Uyning nomi „Midori-so“ 201-xona.

477
00:28:40,688 --> 00:28:49,181
Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Midori-soʻnagi 201-xona, shundaymi?

478
00:28:49,204 --> 00:28:52,475
Ismingizni aytib bering.

479
00:28:52,499 --> 00:28:54,551
Mariya.

480
00:28:54,574 --> 00:28:56,707
Mariya xonim, shundaymi?

481
00:28:56,730 --> 00:28:58,947
Rahmat.

482
00:28:58,971 --> 00:29:01,846
Telefon raqamingiz bormi?

483
00:29:01,869 --> 00:29:04,521
Ha, bor.

484
00:29:04,545 --> 00:29:11,678
090-1234-5678.

485
00:29:11,701 --> 00:29:13,669
Rahmat.

486
00:29:13,692 --> 00:29:16,667
Bugundan boshlab suvdan foydalanasizmi?

487
00:29:16,691 --> 00:29:20,424
Ha, bugundan boshlab ishlatmoqchiman.

488
00:29:20,447 --> 00:29:23,489
Hozir xonada turibman.

489
00:29:23,513 --> 00:29:27,646
Lekin hali joʻmragini ochmaganman.

490
00:29:27,669 --> 00:29:29,669
Shundaymi.

491
00:29:29,692 --> 00:29:34,259
Endi birga tekshirib koʻraylik.

492
00:29:34,282 --> 00:29:36,848
Oshxonaga boring.

493
00:29:36,871 --> 00:29:40,738
Ha, hozir oshxonada turibman.

494
00:29:40,762 --> 00:29:43,962
Joʻmragini sekin aylantiring.

495
00:29:43,985 --> 00:29:46,519
Suv chiqadimi?

496
00:29:46,542 --> 00:29:49,308
Ha, aylantiryapman.

497
00:29:49,331 --> 00:29:52,343
Qiziqib ketdim.

498
00:29:52,367 --> 00:29:55,334
A, suv chiqmayapti.

499
00:29:55,357 --> 00:29:57,836
Nima qilish kerak?

500
00:29:57,859 --> 00:30:00,326
Suv chiqmayaptimi?

501
00:30:00,349 --> 00:30:04,359
Endi tashqaridagi asosiy joʻmragini tekshiramiz.

502
00:30:04,382 --> 00:30:07,382
Asosiy joʻmragimi?

503
00:30:07,405 --> 00:30:09,872
Bu nima?

504
00:30:09,895 --> 00:30:13,862
Tashqaridagi suv valfi.

505
00:30:13,885 --> 00:30:18,528
Kirish eshigi yaqinidagi polga ko‘k quti qo‘yilmaganmi?

506
00:30:18,551 --> 00:30:21,160
Ko‘k quti deysizmi?

507
00:30:21,184 --> 00:30:24,784
Tashqariga bir qarab kelaman.

508
00:30:24,807 --> 00:30:28,174
A, polga ko‘k quti qo‘yilgan ekan.

509
00:30:28,197 --> 00:30:31,063
Shu qutini oching.

510
00:30:31,086 --> 00:30:35,020
Ichida qora dumaloq tutqich bor.

511
00:30:35,043 --> 00:30:37,939
Ha, ochdim.

512
00:30:37,962 --> 00:30:40,653
Qora tutqich bor ekan.

513
00:30:40,677 --> 00:30:45,090
Shu tutqichni o‘ng tomonga ko‘p burang.

514
00:30:45,113 --> 00:30:47,195
Tushunarli.

515
00:30:47,218 --> 00:30:49,115
Burayapman.

516
00:30:49,139 --> 00:30:51,739
Biraz og‘irdek, shundaymi?

517
00:30:51,762 --> 00:30:55,580
A, ko‘p burildi.

518
00:30:55,603 --> 00:30:57,261
Rahmat.

519
00:30:57,285 --> 00:31:01,256
Endi yana oshxonaga qayting.

520
00:31:01,279 --> 00:31:04,214
Ha, qaytdim.

521
00:31:04,238 --> 00:31:07,571
Jarroqni yana oching.

522
00:31:07,594 --> 00:31:10,478
Ha, aylantiryapman.

523
00:31:10,502 --> 00:31:15,335
A, suv shiddat bilan oqib chiqdi!

524
00:31:15,358 --> 00:31:17,837
Juda ham xursandman!

525
00:31:17,861 --> 00:31:20,128
Yaxshi boʻldi.

526
00:31:20,151 --> 00:31:23,027
Endi suv muammosiz chiqdi.

527
00:31:23,050 --> 00:31:26,389
Ha, xotirjam bo‘ldim.

528
00:31:26,413 --> 00:31:29,779
Endi shirin suv ichishimiz mumkin.

529
00:31:29,802 --> 00:31:32,336
Yana bitta jarayon qoldi.

530
00:31:32,359 --> 00:31:34,968
Pochta qutisini ko‘ring.

531
00:31:34,991 --> 00:31:37,058
Pochta qutisimi?

532
00:31:37,081 --> 00:31:39,566
Nima bor?

533
00:31:39,590 --> 00:31:43,956
“Suv ta’minoti uchun ariza” deb yozilgan otkritka bor.

534
00:31:43,979 --> 00:31:46,179
Otkritkami?

535
00:31:46,202 --> 00:31:49,069
A, xonada bor ekan.

536
00:31:49,092 --> 00:31:51,951
Uy egasidan olgan edim.

537
00:31:51,974 --> 00:31:54,741
Yaxshi boʻldi.

538
00:31:54,764 --> 00:32:01,368
Shu otkritkaga bugungi sanani, ismingizni va manzilingizni yozing.

539
00:32:01,392 --> 00:32:04,158
Ism va manzil, shundaymi?

540
00:32:04,181 --> 00:32:06,018
Tushunarli.

541
00:32:06,041 --> 00:32:08,284
Yozing.

542
00:32:08,308 --> 00:32:11,908
So‘ng pochta qutisiga soling.

543
00:32:11,931 --> 00:32:15,164
Marka yopishtirish kerak emasmi?

544
00:32:15,187 --> 00:32:17,244
Marka kerak emas.

545
00:32:17,268 --> 00:32:19,201
Qulay ekan.

546
00:32:19,224 --> 00:32:21,891
Bugun darhol yozib qo‘yaman.

547
00:32:21,915 --> 00:32:24,148
Iltimos.

548
00:32:24,171 --> 00:32:27,771
Bugungi suv ta’minoti bilan bog‘liq jarayon shu bilan tugadi.

549
00:32:27,794 --> 00:32:30,278
Tushunarli.

550
00:32:30,301 --> 00:32:34,784
Yordam berganingiz uchun katta rahmat.

551
00:32:34,807 --> 00:32:37,489
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

552
00:32:37,513 --> 00:32:40,513
Hayotingiz quvonchli bo‘lsin!

553
00:32:40,536 --> 00:32:43,539
Ha, xayr.

554
00:32:43,562 --> 00:32:46,562
8-sahna: Gazni yoqish uchun tekshiruv / Gazni yoqish tekshiruvi

555
00:32:46,562 --> 00:32:48,740
Ding-dong.

556
00:32:48,764 --> 00:32:50,057
Assalomu alaykum.

557
00:32:50,080 --> 00:32:52,698
Janub Gaz xizmati.

558
00:32:52,722 --> 00:32:56,393
Gazni yoqish uchun kelganmiz.

559
00:32:56,416 --> 00:32:58,616
Ha.

560
00:32:58,639 --> 00:33:01,658
A, gaz kompaniyasi xodimi ekan.

561
00:33:01,681 --> 00:33:04,448
Eshikni ochaman.

562
00:33:04,471 --> 00:33:06,046
Xayr.

563
00:33:06,069 --> 00:33:08,803
Janub Gazdan Yamada.

564
00:33:08,826 --> 00:33:13,118
Bugun gazni yoqish uchun kelganmiz.

565
00:33:13,141 --> 00:33:15,775
Ha, men Mariya.

566
00:33:15,798 --> 00:33:17,798
Iltimos.

567
00:33:17,821 --> 00:33:23,118
Xonaga noma'lum odam kiradi, shuning uchun biroz asabiy bo'lyapman.

568
00:33:23,142 --> 00:33:25,708
Ha, shunday, albatta.

569
00:33:25,731 --> 00:33:28,387
Asabiy qilyapman, uzr.

570
00:33:28,411 --> 00:33:31,744
Poyabzalimni echib kiraman.

571
00:33:31,767 --> 00:33:34,136
Ha, iltimos, kiring.

572
00:33:34,160 --> 00:33:36,166
Bu yerga keling, iltimos.

573
00:33:36,189 --> 00:33:37,862
Rahmat.

574
00:33:37,886 --> 00:33:42,155
Avval xonadagi gaz jihozlarini tekshiramiz.

575
00:33:42,179 --> 00:33:45,982
Oshxonadagi gaz plitasi qayerda?

576
00:33:46,005 --> 00:33:48,839
Oshxona shu yerda.

577
00:33:48,862 --> 00:33:51,595
Bu plitadan foydalanmoqchiman.

578
00:33:51,618 --> 00:33:53,351
Rahmat.

579
00:33:53,374 --> 00:33:55,251
Bu, shundaymi?

580
00:33:55,275 --> 00:33:58,009
Xavfsizlik tekshiruvi qilamiz.

581
00:33:58,032 --> 00:34:00,650
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

582
00:34:00,673 --> 00:34:03,492
Ha, tushunarli.

583
00:34:03,515 --> 00:34:06,049
Nimaga qarayapsiz?

584
00:34:06,072 --> 00:34:10,605
Gaz shlangi to'g'ri ulanganligini tekshiryapman.

585
00:34:10,628 --> 00:34:14,995
Gaz sizib chiqmayapti, hammasi joyida.

586
00:34:15,018 --> 00:34:18,351
Shundaymi? Yaxshi bo'ldi.

587
00:34:18,374 --> 00:34:23,107
Gaz biroz qo'rqinchli, shuning uchun xotirjam bo'ldim.

588
00:34:23,130 --> 00:34:27,586
Ha, xavfsizlik eng muhimi.

589
00:34:27,610 --> 00:34:31,543
Endi gaz plitasining yoqish testini qilamiz.

590
00:34:31,566 --> 00:34:35,333
Men hech narsa qilmasam ham bo'ladimi?

591
00:34:35,356 --> 00:34:38,050
Ha, faqat kuzatib turing.

592
00:34:38,074 --> 00:34:42,074
Tugmani bosaman.

593
00:34:42,097 --> 00:34:44,700
Qaq, qaq.

594
00:34:44,723 --> 00:34:46,523
Puff.

595
00:34:46,546 --> 00:34:49,512
Ko'k olov chiqdi.

596
00:34:49,535 --> 00:34:51,735
Ajoyib!

597
00:34:51,758 --> 00:34:55,292
Ha, olov chiroyli chiqdi.

598
00:34:55,315 --> 00:34:57,648
Plita muvaffaqiyatli tekshirildi.

599
00:34:57,671 --> 00:35:02,638
Keyin hammom va yuvinish xonasidagi suv isitgichni tekshiramiz.

600
00:35:02,661 --> 00:35:05,194
Hammom qayerda?

601
00:35:05,217 --> 00:35:08,387
Hammom shu yerda.

602
00:35:08,411 --> 00:35:09,977
Marhamat.

603
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,605
Xayr.

604
00:35:11,629 --> 00:35:15,042
Issiq suv testini qilamiz.

605
00:35:15,065 --> 00:35:17,472
Joʻmrakni ochaman.

606
00:35:17,496 --> 00:35:19,705
Ha, iltimos.

607
00:35:19,729 --> 00:35:23,062
Biroz suv oqizib turamiz.

608
00:35:23,085 --> 00:35:25,618
Gaz ishlayapti.

609
00:35:25,641 --> 00:35:28,841
A, issiq suv chiqdi-ku!

610
00:35:28,864 --> 00:35:30,670
Rostdanmi?

611
00:35:30,694 --> 00:35:34,627
Ha, bu issiq suvga tegib ko'ring.

612
00:35:34,650 --> 00:35:37,217
Issiq ekan-ku!

613
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:39,896
Ha, tegib ko'raman.

614
00:35:39,919 --> 00:35:43,486
Vaa, haqiqatan ham issiq ekan!

615
00:35:43,509 --> 00:35:47,442
Issiq suv to'g'ri chiqyapti.

616
00:35:47,465 --> 00:35:52,499
Ha, shu bilan har kuni issiq hammomga kirishingiz mumkin.

617
00:35:52,522 --> 00:35:54,355
Juda xursandman!

618
00:35:54,378 --> 00:35:59,345
Yaponiyaning qishi sovuq, shuning uchun issiq suv juda yoqadi.

619
00:35:59,368 --> 00:36:01,458
Juda ham xotirjam bo'ldim.

620
00:36:01,482 --> 00:36:06,291
Shu bilan gazning xavfsizlik tekshiruvi va issiq suv testi yakunlandi.

621
00:36:06,314 --> 00:36:08,681
Rahmat.

622
00:36:08,704 --> 00:36:13,039
O'zingiz hech narsa qilishingiz shart emas edi, shundaymi?

623
00:36:13,063 --> 00:36:17,832
Ha, biz hammasini tekshiramiz, xavotir olmang.

624
00:36:17,856 --> 00:36:22,270
Endi, oxirida shu yerga imzo qo'yib yuboring.

625
00:36:22,294 --> 00:36:26,149
Imzo kerakmi? Qayerga yozaman?

626
00:36:26,172 --> 00:36:30,905
Ushbu planshet ekraniga ismingizni yozing.

627
00:36:30,928 --> 00:36:33,461
Tasdiqlandi.

628
00:36:33,484 --> 00:36:36,484
9-Sahna: Yetkazib berilmaganligi haqida bildirishnoma tushuntirishi

629
00:36:36,484 --> 00:36:38,484
Kechirasiz.

630
00:36:38,507 --> 00:36:40,085
Assalomu alaykum.

631
00:36:40,109 --> 00:36:42,794
Nima uchun kelgansiz?

632
00:36:42,818 --> 00:36:48,151
Uyimizning pochta qutisida bu qizil qogʻoz bor edi.

633
00:36:48,174 --> 00:36:52,107
A, bu siz yoʻqligingiz haqida bildirishnoma ekan.

634
00:36:52,130 --> 00:36:56,468
Yoʻqlik bildirishnomasi debmi?

635
00:36:56,492 --> 00:36:59,869
Men juda hayratlandim.

636
00:36:59,893 --> 00:37:03,459
Men nimadir yomon ish qildimmi?

637
00:37:03,482 --> 00:37:07,094
Yoʻq, yomon narsa emas.

638
00:37:07,118 --> 00:37:12,851
Siz uyda yoʻqligingizda pochta xodimi posilkani olib kelgan.

639
00:37:12,874 --> 00:37:17,041
Shuning uchun bu qogʻozni pochta qutisiga solib ketgan.

640
00:37:17,064 --> 00:37:18,597
Shundaymi.

641
00:37:18,620 --> 00:37:21,705
Yomon narsa emas ekan.

642
00:37:21,728 --> 00:37:23,939
Endi xotirjam boʻldim.

643
00:37:23,962 --> 00:37:26,735
Ha, hammasi joyida.

644
00:37:26,759 --> 00:37:29,692
U qizil qogʻozni menga bering.

645
00:37:29,715 --> 00:37:32,115
Ha, iltimos, kiring.

646
00:37:32,138 --> 00:37:33,876
Rahmat.

647
00:37:33,900 --> 00:37:36,598
Posilkani tekshiraman.

648
00:37:36,621 --> 00:37:41,028
A, bu juda muhim xat ekan.

649
00:37:41,051 --> 00:37:43,950
Muhim xatmi?

650
00:37:43,974 --> 00:37:45,910
Nima bu?

651
00:37:45,933 --> 00:37:49,367
Bu immigratsiya idorasidan kelgan hujjat.

652
00:37:49,391 --> 00:37:52,724
Shaxsingizni tasdiqlaymiz.

653
00:37:52,747 --> 00:37:55,645
Pasportingiz bormi?

654
00:37:55,669 --> 00:37:58,319
Ha, sumkamda bor.

655
00:37:58,342 --> 00:38:01,921
Pasportni olib chiqayapman.

656
00:38:01,945 --> 00:38:03,478
Bu.

657
00:38:03,501 --> 00:38:04,935
Marhamat.

658
00:38:04,958 --> 00:38:06,558
Rahmat.

659
00:38:06,581 --> 00:38:09,414
Ismingizni tekshiraman.

660
00:38:09,437 --> 00:38:12,704
Ismingiz Mariya, shundaymi?

661
00:38:12,728 --> 00:38:15,661
Ha, men Mariya.

662
00:38:15,684 --> 00:38:17,917
Manzilingiz Shinjuku-ku, shundaymi?

663
00:38:17,940 --> 00:38:20,993
Ha, Shinjuku-ku.

664
00:38:21,017 --> 00:38:23,217
Ha, tekshirib koʻrdim.

665
00:38:23,240 --> 00:38:25,484
Pasportingizni qaytaraman.

666
00:38:25,508 --> 00:38:27,365
Rahmat.

667
00:38:27,388 --> 00:38:31,154
Endi, bu yerga imzo cheking.

668
00:38:31,177 --> 00:38:32,777
Imzomi?

669
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:35,285
Qayerga yozaman?

670
00:38:35,309 --> 00:38:39,000
Bu oq qogʻozning shu yeriga yozing.

671
00:38:39,023 --> 00:38:41,357
Inglizcha ismimmi?

672
00:38:41,380 --> 00:38:43,316
Katakana yozuvidami?

673
00:38:43,339 --> 00:38:46,905
Pasportdagi kabi yozing.

674
00:38:46,928 --> 00:38:48,728
Tushunarli.

675
00:38:48,751 --> 00:38:51,118
Shu yerga yozaman.

676
00:38:51,141 --> 00:38:52,953
Tayyor bo'ldim.

677
00:38:52,976 --> 00:38:55,023
Rahmat.

678
00:38:55,047 --> 00:38:57,919
Endi posilkangizni olib kelaman.

679
00:38:57,943 --> 00:39:00,143
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

680
00:39:00,166 --> 00:39:02,623
Ha, tushunarli.

681
00:39:02,646 --> 00:39:04,822
Kutib turdingiz, rahmat.

682
00:39:04,846 --> 00:39:07,379
Bu koʻk konvert.

683
00:39:07,403 --> 00:39:08,769
Marhamat.

684
00:39:08,792 --> 00:39:10,459
Rahmat.

685
00:39:10,482 --> 00:39:13,615
A, ichida karta bor ekan.

686
00:39:13,638 --> 00:39:17,111
Bu mening yashash kartammi?

687
00:39:17,135 --> 00:39:19,703
Ha, shunday.

688
00:39:19,726 --> 00:39:23,360
Bu juda muhim karta, uni ehtiyot qiling.

689
00:39:23,383 --> 00:39:26,116
Ha, tushundim.

690
00:39:26,139 --> 00:39:29,107
Bugundan boshlab doimo olib yuraman.

691
00:39:29,130 --> 00:39:32,897
Bugundan boshlab Yaponiyada hayotingiz boshlanadi.

692
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:34,564
Omadingizni bersin!

693
00:39:34,587 --> 00:39:37,206
Rahmat.

694
00:39:37,230 --> 00:39:41,364
Pochta xodimi juda mehribon edi.

695
00:39:41,387 --> 00:39:43,630
Juda xursand boʻldim.

696
00:39:43,653 --> 00:39:46,140
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

697
00:39:46,164 --> 00:39:47,730
Xayr.

698
00:39:47,753 --> 00:39:49,401
Xayr.

699
00:39:49,425 --> 00:39:52,425
10-Sahna: Yapon kasalxonasiga birinchi tashrif

700
00:39:52,425 --> 00:39:54,360
Kechirasiz.

701
00:39:54,383 --> 00:39:55,802
Assalomu alaykum.

702
00:39:55,826 --> 00:39:58,959
Bugun nima uchun keldingiz?

703
00:39:58,982 --> 00:40:01,982
Kecha kechdan beri isitmam bor.

704
00:40:02,005 --> 00:40:05,180
Tananom juda ogʻriyapti.

705
00:40:05,204 --> 00:40:07,898
Bu juda yomon ekan.

706
00:40:07,922 --> 00:40:10,964
Bu kasalxonaga birinchi marta kelayapsizmi?

707
00:40:10,988 --> 00:40:13,998
Ha, birinchi marta.

708
00:40:14,021 --> 00:40:19,454
Yapon kasalxonalari uchun bu mening birinchi tashrifim, shuning uchun juda xavotirdaman.

709
00:40:19,477 --> 00:40:21,736
Hech qisiqmasin.

710
00:40:21,760 --> 00:40:24,006
Xavotir olmang.

711
00:40:24,029 --> 00:40:28,510
Avvalambor, sogʻliq sugʻurta guvohnomangiz bormi?

712
00:40:28,534 --> 00:40:31,471
Ha, bor.

713
00:40:31,495 --> 00:40:34,695
Oʻtgan hafta tuman idorasidan oldim.

714
00:40:34,718 --> 00:40:36,553
Bu.

715
00:40:36,576 --> 00:40:38,228
Marhamat.

716
00:40:38,252 --> 00:40:40,052
Rahmat.

717
00:40:40,075 --> 00:40:42,120
Olip qolaman.

718
00:40:42,144 --> 00:40:44,956
Ha, tekshirdim.

719
00:40:44,979 --> 00:40:49,412
Endi, avval isitmani oʻlchang.

720
00:40:49,435 --> 00:40:52,522
Isitmani oʻlchaymi?

721
00:40:52,546 --> 00:40:55,585
Qanday qilib oʻlchaymiz?

722
00:40:55,609 --> 00:40:59,622
Bu termometrdan foydalaning.

723
00:40:59,645 --> 00:41:02,120
Qoʻltiq ostingizga qoʻying.

724
00:41:02,143 --> 00:41:04,743
Tushunarli.

725
00:41:04,766 --> 00:41:07,047
Qoʻltiq ostimga, shundaymi?

726
00:41:07,071 --> 00:41:11,204
Ovoz chiqquncha biroz kutib turing.

727
00:41:11,227 --> 00:41:13,160
Yaxshi.

728
00:41:13,183 --> 00:41:16,317
A, ovoz chiqdi.

729
00:41:16,340 --> 00:41:18,573
Koʻrsatib bering.

730
00:41:18,596 --> 00:41:21,563
38,5 daraja ekan.

731
00:41:21,586 --> 00:41:24,406
Isitmangiz juda baland ekan.

732
00:41:24,429 --> 00:41:28,524
Ha, juda sovuq qotayapman.

733
00:41:28,548 --> 00:41:34,194
Endi, bu anketani toʻldiring.

734
00:41:34,217 --> 00:41:37,784
Anketa, desizmi?

735
00:41:37,807 --> 00:41:40,977
Koʻp kanji belgilari bor.

736
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:43,973
Men yozolmayman.

737
00:41:43,996 --> 00:41:45,996
Tushunarli.

738
00:41:46,019 --> 00:41:49,719
Unda, men savollar beraman.

739
00:41:49,742 --> 00:41:52,909
Siz javob bering.

740
00:41:52,932 --> 00:41:55,265
Rahmat.

741
00:41:55,288 --> 00:41:57,387
Bu menga katta yordam boʻladi.

742
00:41:57,411 --> 00:42:01,270
Hozir eng qayeringiz ogʻriyapti?

743
00:42:01,294 --> 00:42:05,097
Boshim va tomogʻim juda ogʻriyapti.

744
00:42:05,120 --> 00:42:08,787
Bosh va tomoq, shundaymi?

745
00:42:08,810 --> 00:42:11,902
Yoʻtal yoki burun oqishi bormi?

746
00:42:11,925 --> 00:42:16,597
Yoʻtal biroz bor, lekin burun oqishi yoʻq.

747
00:42:16,620 --> 00:42:18,454
Tushunarli.

748
00:42:18,477 --> 00:42:21,330
Isitma qachondan beri?

749
00:42:21,353 --> 00:42:24,787
Kecha kechdan beri isitmam bor.

750
00:42:24,810 --> 00:42:27,425
Kecha kechdan beri, shundaymi?

751
00:42:27,449 --> 00:42:30,015
Ovqat yedingizmi?

752
00:42:30,038 --> 00:42:34,438
Yoʻq, kechadan beri hech narsa yemadim.

753
00:42:34,461 --> 00:42:37,339
Qorni ogʻriyapti.

754
00:42:37,363 --> 00:42:41,022
Bu juda achinarli.

755
00:42:41,046 --> 00:42:43,812
Dori allergiyangiz bormi?

756
00:42:43,835 --> 00:42:46,293
Yoʻq, yoʻq.

757
00:42:46,316 --> 00:42:50,807
Hozir boshqa kasalxonaning dorilarini ichayapsizmi?

758
00:42:50,831 --> 00:42:54,564
Yoʻq, hech narsa ichmayapman.

759
00:42:54,587 --> 00:42:56,521
Tushunarli.

760
00:42:56,545 --> 00:43:00,483
Shu bilan anketani toʻldirish tugadi.

761
00:43:00,506 --> 00:43:02,483
Rahmat.

762
00:43:02,507 --> 00:43:05,311
Siz mehribon inson ekanligingizdan xursandman.

763
00:43:05,334 --> 00:43:08,368
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

764
00:43:08,391 --> 00:43:12,288
Iltimos, u yerda joylashgan divanga oʻtiring.

765
00:43:12,311 --> 00:43:17,344
Oʻqituvchi ismingizni chaqirguncha kutib turing.

766
00:43:17,367 --> 00:43:19,946
Ha, tushundim.

767
00:43:19,970 --> 00:43:22,304
Oʻtirib kutaman.